 "short_name": "Emthanjeni",
 "_doc": "Munsoft-family 'TAX INVOICE / BELASTINGFAKTUUR' (bilingual labels 'Statement Date/Staat Datum', 'Month/Maand'); the masthead + ledger header repeat on every page, service sub-headings ('Electricity', 'Interest', 'Water' ...) sit on their own lines. Electricity = one 'Elec Cons-KWH nKWH - [start to end]' ledger line (VAT, Debit incl VAT, Balance) followed by a meter-detail row (Meter Number, Factor, Date From/To, Rate, Units, Reading Type, Exclusive) and one 'Elec Basic - <tariff> - Units n' line; 'Interest - Elec ...' lines are NOT counted. Flat energy mapped to standard_kwh/standard_r. FINGERPRINT: the municipality's own VAT number as printed in the masthead + its name / web domain. total_ex_vat_r = (Debit - VAT) over the Elec Cons and Elec Basic lines; identity emt_check_excl_r = the printed 'Exclusive' column of the meter-detail row + basic ex VAT (energy verified independently, basic circular). Checked on 10 bills.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4150193474"
  ],
  "any": [
   "Emthanjeni Local Municipality",
   "emthanjeni.co.za"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": []
 },
